  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SISF Lithuania</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">TA-fond Litauen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Fonden skall st&#xf6;dja utvecklingen av ett regulj&#xe4;rt samarbete mellan Sverige och Litauen genom att den litauiska sidan genom fonden f&#xe5;r ett st&#xf6;rre ansvar f&#xf6;r projekthantering. Fonden kan st&#xf6;dja mindre insatser som syftar till implementering av Litauens NPAA.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Swedish Institutional Support Fund is to promote the transition process from development cooperation to regular non-subsidised cooperation between Sweden and Lithuania and to serve as a complement to EU supported programmes. The Fund will be used for small technical assistance projects within the framework of the National Programme for the Adoption of the Aquis.</narrative>
  </description>
